            "created_at": "2025-07-31T14:24:12.496311+00:00",
            "notes": "- Feel free to move around the Powers from Round 3 through 7 depending on your playstyle.\n\n- There's definitely an argument to take [Precarious Potency](item_b1305ee6-3027-4131-8797-dcbeb68e3953) in Round 3 here if you're not an aggressive enough Moira. The more damage and healing numbers you can output, the more money you make each round. [Precarious Potency](item_b1305ee6-3027-4131-8797-dcbeb68e3953) is probably the best Power to keep those stats padded.\n\n- Another good option from here forward is that if you're struggling with a good Freja, consider [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) at any point, especially combined with [Subatomic Splitter](item_a5df2382-7249-43ad-b891-b8e465e9744e).",
